  "question": "What\u2019s the nearest restaurant on the way from UIS Greenhouse, Springfield, IL toward DIM Art House, Springfield, IL?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.6166 39.728376)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.688539 39.797952)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.6166 39.728376)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.6166 39.728376)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
